7. Adblock filter subscriptions — fetched at runtime, NOT bundled
----------------------------------------------------------------------

The default subscription list (src/adblock/adblockmanager.cpp) points at
EasyList, EasyPrivacy and uBlock filters. These lists are downloaded by
the user's browser at runtime; no rules are shipped in this repository.

  * EasyList / EasyPrivacy: dual-licensed GNU GPLv3 and
